# 7. Count Odd Numbers

### Code

```java
package p1;

public class CountOdd {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int[] arr = {10, 15, 22, 7, 8, 13};

        int count = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {

            if (arr[i] % 2 != 0) {
                count++;
            }
        }

        System.out.println("Count = " + count);
    }
}
```

### Output

```text
Count = 3
```

### Important Points

Even:

```java
arr[i] % 2 == 0
```

Odd:

```java
arr[i] % 2 != 0
```

### Complexity

```text
Time  : O(n)
Space : O(1)
```

